{#- Round 37 · the page of ONE event, or of one monthly series — every event /events/ lists has one (but a committee
    meeting: its page is /meetings/#committee-meeting), built at every build from the data alone
    (eleventy/event-pages.js eventPagePlan: which page, its tier, its address; eleventy/event-page-model.js
    eventPageData: what it says). Included by the three templates that write them, which differ only in their tier:
      src/pages/event-share-leaf.njk    an event still to come (indexable, in the sitemap; its Event's structured data
                                        when it is a "leaf": share.ld);
      src/pages/event-share-date.njk    a date of a monthly series, an event from Grapevine's or La Viña's own calendar,
                                        an event that is over (noindex, out of the sitemap);
      src/pages/event-share-series.njk  a monthly series' page, /events/series/<key>/ (indexable).
    `share` is the page's entry (eventPageData: { lang, path, tier, ld, target, hubPath, head, ev, kind, m … }); its
    model `share.m` gives the keys, the template translates them (macros/event-page.njk). Everything is written in the
    page — no script needed to read it:
      · the Event's structured data FIRST in the body (cmEventPageLd: the same Event as /events/ gives it — never a
        meeting link, ID or code, never a person's name), only for a leaf;
      · the hero: the title (h1), its day and time (a series: how often) and its actions, above the fold on a phone —
        while it is to come, Join online (online), Add to calendar and Directions (a real address: a map) —, then, on
        a series' date, "All dates" (its series' page) and, quieter, "See all events" (its card on /events/; a
        series' page: /events/);
      · the breadcrumb (Home › Events › [its series ›] the page), "This event is over", "Details to be confirmed",
        "One date of <its series>";
      · the lede — one plain sentence: what it is, when, where (the platform's name only, online), that it is held in
        Spanish (when the data says so), who organizes it (our committee by its name in the page's language);
      · the event's card, as on /events/ (its kind, its place, how to join, the whole description, View flyer, its
        outside page — "Organizer's page ↗" —, Share; Join online and Add to calendar are the hero's) — once it is
        over, none of how to join: no meeting ID, its summary without the sentences that give one
        (withoutJoinDetails) and never its body;
        a series' page: how to join its next date and its summary, its flyer under it, then its next 6 dates (each
        to its date's page);
      · the quick facts (a map link for an event still to come at a real address) — after the card in the page (on a
        phone the card's buttons come first), beside it from 64rem;
      · "Get ready" ("Learn more" once it is over): the presentation of its kind (/orientation/?present=<id>), its
        GVR/RLV Bingo card made for it (the builder filled in), the pages and guides of its kind (the booth display,
        Share your story, the writing guides, GVR / RLV 101 …);
      · the next event of its kind, what else is coming up (and the next committee meeting), past events like it,
        flyers of similar events, the magazines of its month (and the newest Grapevine issue for the Grapevine
        Meeting) — each of these blocks data-lastmod="skip": they change with the other events and the months, not
        with this page, so they never re-date it in the sitemap (eleventy/lastmod.js). A series' list of its dates is
        its own content: not skipped;
      · Subscribe to the calendar, "See all events" again; the flyer viewer (its words kept out of search snippets:
        data-nosnippet). -#}
{% import "macros/ui.njk" as ui with context %}
{% import "macros/events.njk" as evm with context %}
{% import "macros/event-page.njk" as evp with context %}
{%- set m = share.m -%}
{%- set ev = share.ev -%}
{%- set series = m.mode == "series" -%}
{%- set tone = ev | eventTone -%}
{%- set selfAbs = page.url | siteUrl(site) -%}
{%- set when = share.series.recurrence if series else (ev.rangeLabel if ev.multiDay else ev.shareWhen) -%}
{%- set title = share.series.title if series else ev.title -%}
{%- set kindName = share.kind.label | t(lang) -%}
{%- if share.ld %}{%- set ld = ev | cmEventPageLd(site, lang, selfAbs) -%}{% if ld %}<script type="application/ld+json">{{ ld | rpJson | safe }}</script>{% endif %}{% endif %}
{#- the hero's actions, above the fold on a phone: while it is to come, Join online (an online event: its link), Add
    to calendar (the FULL Google / Outlook links, the .ics file — one event: no weight to save) and Directions (a map
    of its real address: the quick facts' map link); then "All dates" (a series' date: its series' page) and, quieter,
    "See all events" (its card on /events/). Once it is over: those two only. The menu's panel hangs below the hero
    (committee.css: the hero lets it show while it is open). -#}
{%- set maps = [] -%}{%- for f in m.facts %}{% if f.map and maps.push(f.map) %}{% endif %}{% endfor -%}
{%- set mapHref = maps[0] if not ev.past else "" -%}
{% call ui.pageHero(lang, title, when | escape, "repeat" if series else "calendar-days", kindName) %}
  <div class="hero-actions evp-hero-actions">
    {%- if not ev.past %}
    {%- if ev.online %}
    <a class="btn-light" href="{{ ev.online }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{% icon "video", "size-4" %} {{ "committee.events.join_online" | t(lang) }}<span class="sr-only"> ({{ "common.external" | t(lang) }})</span></a>
    {%- endif %}
    <details class="cm-menu">
      <summary class="{{ 'btn-on-dark' if ev.online else 'btn-light' }}">{% icon "calendar-plus", "size-4" %} {{ "common.add_to_calendar" | t(lang) }}</summary>
      <div class="cm-menu-panel">
        <a href="{{ ev.gcal }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{% icon "calendar", "size-4" %} Google Calendar</a>
        <a href="{{ ev.outlook }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{% icon "calendar", "size-4" %} Outlook.com</a>
        <button type="button" data-cm-ics="{{ ev.icsData | json }}" data-cm-js>{% icon "download", "size-4" %} {{ "committee.cal.ics_file" | t(lang) }}</button>
        <p class="cm-menu-note" data-cm-js>{{ ("committee.cal.reminder_day" if ev.allDay else "committee.cal.reminder_timed") | t(lang) }}</p>
      </div>
    </details>
    {%- if mapHref %}
    <a class="btn-on-dark" href="{{ mapHref }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{% icon "map", "size-4" %} {{ "evpage.directions" | t(lang) }}<span class="sr-only"> — {{ "evpage.map_aria" | t(lang, { place: ev.location }) }} ({{ "common.external" | t(lang) }})</span></a>
    {%- endif %}
    {%- endif %}
    {%- if m.banners.partOf %}
    <a class="btn-on-dark btn-sm" href="{{ m.banners.partOf.href }}">{% icon "repeat", "size-4" %} {{ "evpage.sec.all_dates" | t(lang) }}</a>
    {%- endif %}
    <a class="btn-on-dark btn-sm evp-hero-all" href="{{ share.target }}">{% icon "calendar-days", "size-4" %} {{ "committee.events.page_all" | t(lang) }}</a>
  </div>
{% endcall %}

<div class="container-page section pt-6 sm:pt-8">
<div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
  {#- (its last step: the page's own title — with its day —, as the site's graph names it: base.njk) -#}
  {{ evp.crumbs(m.crumbs, share.head.title) }}
  {{ evp.banners(m.banners) }}
  {{ evp.lede(m.lede, title, share.kind.phrase | t(lang)) }}

  {#- the card first, then the quick facts (on a phone: its Join and Add to calendar within reach, under the lede; from
      64rem the facts beside it, on the right — committee.css .evp-top) -#}
  <div class="evp-top">
    <div class="evp-top-main min-w-0">
    {%- if series %}
      {#- a series' page: its summary and how to join its next date (online: the link, its code — never quoted by search
          engines: data-nosnippet, translate="no"), its flyer -#}
      <article class="card card-pad ev-accent ev-tone-{{ tone }} evp-series-card">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5">
          {{ evm.kindBadge(ev, tone) }}
          {% if not ev.ownWords %}{{ ui.langPill(ev.item, lang) }}{% endif %}
        </div>
        {% if share.series.summary %}<p class="mt-3 text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-muted">{{ share.series.summary | escape | cmNoSnippet | safe }}</p>{% endif %}
        {%- if ev.isOnline and (ev.online or ev.meetingId) %}
        <h2 class="h-card mt-5 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-gv">{% icon "video", "size-5" %}</span>{{ "evpage.sec.join" | t(lang) }}</h2>
        <ul class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-1.5 text-sm text-muted">
          <li class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">{% icon "video", "size-4 text-faint" %} {{ ("committee.events.online_on" | t(lang, { platform: ev.platform })) if ev.platform else ("committee.events.online" | t(lang)) }}</li>
          {% if ev.meetingId %}<li class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">{% icon "hash", "size-4 text-faint" %} <span>{{ ev.meetingIdKey | t(lang) }} <span class="inline-block whitespace-nowrap font-mono font-medium text-ink" translate="no" data-nosnippet>{{ ev.meetingId }}</span></span></li>{% endif %}
        </ul>
        {%- endif %}
        <div class="evp-btns">
          {{ ui.flyerButton(m.flyer, title, lang) }}
          <button type="button" class="btn-ghost btn-sm" data-js-only data-share="{{ selfAbs }}" data-share-title="{{ title }}" data-share-text="{{ when }}">{% icon "share-2", "size-4" %}<span>{{ "common.share" | t(lang) }}</span></button>
        </div>
      </article>
      {#- its own flyer (its next date's), under its card: near the top, beside the quick facts from 64rem -#}
      {%- if m.flyer %}
      <section class="mt-6" aria-labelledby="evp-flyer-h">
        <h2 id="evp-flyer-h" class="h-card flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-gv">{% icon "file-image", "size-5" %}</span>{{ "evpage.sec.flyer" | t(lang) }}</h2>
        {{ evp.flyerTiles([{ title: title, view: m.flyer.view, preview: m.flyer.preview, thumb: m.flyer.thumb }]) }}
      </section>
      {%- endif %}
    {%- else %}
      {#- the event's card, as on /events/ (committee.css .cm-event, in its kind's colour) -#}
      <article class="card cm-event evp-card ev-accent ev-tone-{{ tone }}">
        <div class="cm-date-tile{{ ' cm-tile-range' if ev.tile.range }} max-sm:hidden" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="cm-tile-mon">{{ ev.tile.mon }}</span>
          <span class="cm-tile-day">{{ ev.tile.day }}</span>
          <span class="cm-tile-wd">{{ ev.tile.wd }}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5">
            {{ evm.kindBadge(ev, tone) }}
            {% if ev.tentative %}{{ ui.tentativeBadge(lang) }}{% endif %}
            {% if not ev.ownWords %}{{ ui.langPill(ev.item, lang) }}{% endif %}
          </div>
          <ul class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-1.5 text-sm text-muted">
            {% if ev.location %}<li class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-start gap-1.5">{% set lIcon = "hourglass" if ev.locationTba else "map-pin" %}{% icon lIcon, "mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-faint" %} <span class="min-w-0 font-medium text-ink{{ ' italic' if ev.locationTba }}">{{ ev.location }}</span></li>{% endif %}
            {% if ev.isOnline %}<li class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">{% icon "video", "size-4 text-faint" %} {{ ("committee.events.online_on" | t(lang, { platform: ev.platform })) if ev.platform else ("committee.events.online" | t(lang)) }}</li>{% endif %}
            {#- (how to join: only while it is still to come — the number moves to the next line in one piece; never
                quoted by search engines, data-nosnippet) -#}
            {% if ev.meetingId and not ev.past %}<li class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">{% icon "hash", "size-4 text-faint" %} <span>{{ ev.meetingIdKey | t(lang) }} <span class="inline-block whitespace-nowrap font-mono font-medium text-ink" translate="no" data-nosnippet>{{ ev.meetingId }}</span></span></li>{% endif %}
            {% if ev.contact %}<li class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1.5">{% icon "mail", "size-4 shrink-0 text-faint" %} <a class="link tap-link min-w-0 break-words" href="mailto:{{ ev.contact }}" translate="no"><span class="sr-only">{{ "committee.events.contact" | t(lang) }}: </span>{{ ev.contact | replace("@", "@<wbr>") | safe }}</a></li>{% endif %}
          </ul>
          {%- set foreign = not ev.ownWords and ev.item.lang and ev.item.lang != lang and ev.item.lang != "und" and not (ev.item | machineFor(lang)) -%}
          {#- the whole description while it is to come (a meeting ID, Meet code, passcode or meeting address in it:
              never quoted by search engines — cmNoSnippet); once it is over, its summary without how to join -#}
          {% if ev.past %}
          {% if m.summary %}<p class="mt-4 text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-muted"{% if foreign %} lang="{{ ev.item.lang }}"{% endif %}>{{ m.summary | excerpt(2000) | escape | cmNoSnippet | safe }}</p>{% endif %}
          {% elif ev.body %}
          <div class="prose-site cm-md mt-4 max-w-none text-[0.95rem]"{% if foreign %} lang="{{ ev.item.lang }}"{% endif %}>{{ ev.body | md({ h: 2, lang: lang, name: ev.title }) | cmNoSnippet | safe }}</div>
          {% elif ev.summary %}
          <p class="mt-4 text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-muted"{% if foreign %} lang="{{ ev.item.lang }}"{% endif %}>{{ ev.summary | excerpt(2000) | escape | cmNoSnippet | safe }}</p>
          {% endif %}
          {% if ev.item | machineFor(lang) %}<p class="mt-1.5">{{ ui.autoNote(ev.item, lang) }}</p>{% endif %}
          {#- the card's buttons (committee.css .cm-ev-actions): its flyer, its outside page and Share — Join online and
              Add to calendar are in the hero -#}
          <div class="cm-ev-actions">
            <div class="cm-ev-btns">
            {{ ui.flyerButton(ev.flyer, ev.title, lang) }}
            {% if ev.link and ev.linkExternal and ev.link != (ev.flyer.view if ev.flyer else "") %}
            <a class="btn-secondary btn-sm" href="{{ ev.link }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{% icon "external-link", "size-4" %} <span class="sm:hidden" aria-hidden="true">{{ "evlist.organizer_short" | t(lang) }}</span><span class="max-sm:sr-only">{{ "evlist.organizer" | t(lang) }}</span> <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="sr-only"> ({{ "common.external" | t(lang) }})</span></a>
            {% endif %}
            </div>
            <button type="button" class="btn-ghost btn-sm max-sm:mt-2 sm:max-xl:px-2.5" data-js-only data-share="{{ selfAbs }}" data-share-title="{{ ev.title }}" data-share-text="{{ when }}">{% icon "share-2", "size-4" %}<span class="sm:max-xl:sr-only">{{ "common.share" | t(lang) }}</span></button>
          </div>
        </div>
        {{ ui.flyerThumb(ev.flyer, ev.title, lang) }}
      </article>
    {%- endif %}
    </div>
    <div class="evp-top-facts">{{ evp.facts(m.facts) }}</div>
  </div>

  {#- a series' dates — on its page (its own content: in the page's sitemap date) and on each date's page -#}
  {%- if m.dates | length %}
  <section class="mt-12" aria-labelledby="evp-dates-h"{% if not series %} data-lastmod="skip"{% endif %}>
    {{ evp.head("evp-dates-h", "evpage.sec.dates" | t(lang), "", "calendar-range", "", m.banners.partOf.href if m.banners.partOf else "", "evpage.sec.all_dates" | t(lang)) }}
    {{ evp.minis(m.dates) }}
  </section>
  {%- endif %}

  {{ evp.prep(m.prep, ev.past) }}

  {#- the other events (they change with those events, not with this page: out of the sitemap's date) -#}
  {%- set nm = m.meeting -%}
  {%- if m.nextSame or (m.coming | length) or nm %}
  <div class="mt-12 grid gap-12" data-lastmod="skip">
    {%- if m.nextSame %}
    <section aria-labelledby="evp-next-h">
      {#- ("Next writing workshop": the kind's name in the sentence — its first letter small, but a name such as "Area
          assembly" or "GSR/DCM orientation"; in Spanish "Próximo: Taller de escritura") -#}
      {%- set inName = kindName if (lang != "en" or kindName.slice(0, 5) == "Area " or kindName.charAt(1) == (kindName.charAt(1) | upper)) else (kindName.charAt(0) | lower) + kindName.slice(1) -%}
      {{ evp.head("evp-next-h", "evpage.sec.next_same" | t(lang, { kind: inName }), "", "calendar-check") }}
      {{ evp.minis([m.nextSame]) }}
    </section>
    {%- endif %}
    {%- if (m.coming | length) or nm %}
    <section aria-labelledby="evp-coming-h">
      {{ evp.head("evp-coming-h", "evpage.sec.coming" | t(lang), "", "calendar-days", "", "/events/" | lurl(lang), "committee.events.page_all" | t(lang)) }}
      {% if m.coming | length %}{{ evp.minis(m.coming) }}{% endif %}
      {% if nm %}<p class="mt-4 flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-muted">{% icon "users", "mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-faint" %}<a class="link tap-link" href="{{ '/meetings/#committee-meeting' | lurl(lang) }}">{{ "evpage.sec.next_meeting" | t(lang, { when: nm.when }) }}</a></p>{% endif %}
    </section>
    {%- endif %}
  </div>
  {%- endif %}

  {%- if m.pastSame | length %}
  <section class="mt-12" aria-labelledby="evp-past-h" data-lastmod="skip">
    {{ evp.head("evp-past-h", "evpage.sec.past_same" | t(lang), "", "history") }}
    {{ evp.minis(m.pastSame, true, "sm:grid-cols-2") }}
  </section>
  {%- endif %}

  {%- if m.flyers | length %}
  <section class="mt-12" aria-labelledby="evp-flyers-h" data-lastmod="skip">
    {{ evp.head("evp-flyers-h", "evpage.sec.flyers" | t(lang), "", "images", "", "/portfolio/#docs-flyers" | lurl(lang), "evpage.sec.flyers_all" | t(lang)) }}
    {{ evp.flyerTiles(m.flyers) }}
  </section>
  {%- endif %}

  {#- the magazines of its month (this month's, or the event's): each issue, "Coming soon" while it is not out; its
      monthly toolkit; for the Grapevine Meeting also Grapevine's newest issue (we read a story from it) -#}
  {%- set mo = m.month -%}
  {%- set newest = (db.articles.items | homeLatestIssue(m.latest, 0, db.articles.issues, lang)) if m.latest else null -%}
  {%- set showNewest = newest and newest.key and not (mo and mo.gv and mo.key == newest.key) -%}
  {%- if mo and (mo.gv or mo.lv or mo.toolkit) or showNewest %}
  {#- (the month inside a sentence: "The magazines in December 2026", "Las revistas de diciembre de 2026") -#}
  {%- set monthName = ev.monthLabel if lang == "en" else (ev.monthLabel.charAt(0) | lower) + ev.monthLabel.slice(1) -%}
  <section class="mt-12" aria-labelledby="evp-month-h" data-lastmod="skip">
    {{ evp.head("evp-month-h", ("evpage.sec.month_h" | t(lang)) if (mo and mo.current) else ("evpage.sec.month_h_of" | t(lang, { month: monthName })), ("evpage.sec.month" | t(lang)) if (mo and mo.current) else ("evpage.sec.month_of" | t(lang, { month: monthName })), "book-open", "", mo.toolkit if mo else "", ("evpage.sec.toolkit" | t(lang, { month: monthName })) if (mo and mo.toolkit) else "") }}
    <div class="mt-5 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      {% if mo and mo.gv %}{{ evp.issue(mo.gv, "gv") }}{% endif %}
      {% if mo and mo.lv %}{{ evp.issue(mo.lv, "lv") }}{% endif %}
      {% if showNewest %}{{ evp.issue({ label: newest.label | homeIssueLabel(lang), theme: newest.topic, themeLang: newest.topicLang, url: newest.url, cover: newest.cover, soon: not newest.url }, m.latest, "evpage.sec.latest" | t(lang)) }}{% endif %}
    </div>
  </section>
  {%- endif %}

  <div class="mt-12">{% cmSubscribe lang, site %}</div>
  <p class="mt-6"><a class="link tap-link inline-flex items-center gap-1.5" href="{{ share.target }}">{% icon "arrow-left", "size-4 shrink-0" %}{{ "committee.events.page_all" | t(lang) }}</a></p>
</div>
</div>

<div data-nosnippet>{% cmPreviewDialog lang %}</div>
